  "question": {
    "text": "The denticity of the ligand present in the Fehling&#39;s reagent is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Denticity is defined as the number of electron pairs donated by a ligand to a central atom. Denticity of the ligand present in fehling&#39;s solution(Copper tartarate complex) is 2 based on the given diagram. But the maximum denticity is 4.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a4a03172-9e4d-4027-8930-56bf1eb80202-9895146.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 331px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
